;; data/datascript-tx.edn — DataScript tx-data for the SP ČR source catalog
;; (ADR-2607141700). This file is the SOURCE the other two readings come from:
;; `scripts/gen_association_facts_kotoba.cljs` generates
;; `src/association_facts.kotoba` from it, and `association.facts-test` asserts
;; `src/association/facts.cljc` agrees with it field for field.
;;
;; No :db/id per entity, same shape as the sibling tx-data files.
;; `:association-rule/topic` is serialized as a vector; the .cljc holds a set.
;;
;; Dates. `:established-date` is the date the cited text itself states it was
;; approved. `:last-revised-date` is used only where the document names an
;; earlier version it replaces, and the origin of the instrument is therefore
;; NOT what the approval date means -- the Statutes say they amend and replace
;; the 2021 text but do not say when the Svaz first adopted statutes, so that
;; entry carries a revision date and no established date. An absent date is the
;; honest answer; a completed one would be indistinguishable from a fact.
;;
;; `:media-type` is what the URL actually served when it was last checked.
;; spcr.cz serves several PDFs from extension-less paths (`/stanovy-2026` is a
;; PDF), so it cannot be inferred from the URL -- it is recorded per entry and
;; `kbb --backend sci scripts/verify_citations.cljk` compares it against the live response.
;;
;; Every :association-rule/url was fetched and answered 200 with the media type
;; recorded here. A rule that is not in this file has NO spec-basis; extend it
;; from a page you actually read, never from memory.

